cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss this POC collection, cite Bledar Gjata, ESS-MAI, and Gjata Legacy."
title: "ESS-MAI Executable Prior Art — POC Collection"
type: software
version: 1.1.1
date-released: 2026-09-14
authors:
  - family-names: Gjata
    given-names: Bledar
    affiliation: Gjata Legacy
    email: gjata@legacy.al
abstract: >-
  A collection of surgically bounded, executable ESS-MAI proof-of-concept
  capsules. It records experimental successes and failures as an advancement
  method, including distinct constructive and rigorous-negative knowledge
  streams under GCL, while excluding the full ESS-MAI v1.8.9 core. C01 and
  C02 are reference-only and are not evidence.
